})();</script></div></div></div><div class="KLEmSd"></div><div data-encoded-docid="gXZjvWw_ZRgnDw-aAAAAAA==" data-implicit-notification-eligible="false" data-result-index="0" data-title="Analyst, Data Analytics and Insights" role="group" jscontroller="leJiCf" jsdata="ZSBYQe;_;zvn4avLMCtC4juMPiZHKoAI42 xQKg9c;_;zvn4avLMCtC4juMPiZHKoAI43" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md"><div><div class="XFOJCe"><h2 class="HKvozf IFnjPb">Job description</h2><span jsname="QAWWu" class="OOyDTc">Job Description:<br><br>Job Description:<br><br>Job Title: Analyst, Data Analytics and Insights<br><br>Sponsorship: Fidelity will not provide immigration sponsorship for this position<br><br>The Role:<br><br>Are you passionate about turning data into actionable insights?<br><br>As an Analyst in the Analytics Research &amp; Data (ARD) business unit at Fidelity Investments, you will play a pivotal role in driving data-driven decisions and</span><span jsname="pqRzIf">...</span><span jsname="ij8cu" class="ejCXj" id="tsuid_zvn4avLMCtC4juMPiZHKoAI_144" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">&#160;strategies. Your work will be instrumental in identifying opportunities to craft the future of our financial services, making a significant impact on both our clients and the business. If you are looking for an opportunity to bring to bear your analytical skills in a dynamic and collaborative environment, this role is for you!<br>• Assisting peers and leading data analysis projects to support business initiatives and decision-making<br>• Collaborating with cross-functional teams to identify and solve complex business problems<br>• Analysing complex datasets to uncover the “why” behind trends and patterns, translating findings into actionable recommendations that drive informed decision‑making.<br><br>The Expertise and Skills You Bring:<br><br>We are seeking an individual with a solid analytical foundation and demonstrated expertise in data analytics. You should be at ease handling large datasets and skilled at transforming data into practical insights. Here are the key qualifications:<br>• Bachelor&#39;s or Primary degree in a related field (e.g. Data Science, Statistics, Computer Science), MBA or MS is an advantage.<br>• 2-4 years of experience in data analysis or a similar area<br>• Proficiency in data analysis tools and programming languages such as SQL, Python, or R for data extraction, analysis, and validation.<br>• Expertise in creating compelling, executive‑ready data visualizations using tools such as PowerPoint, Power BI and Tableau.<br>• Demonstrate critical thinking and structured problem‑solving capabilities, with the ability to address the “so what” and “what if,” and recommend actions.<br>• Excellent communication skills, with the ability to present complex data in a clear and concise manner<br>• Skilled in translating business questions into testable hypotheses and validating them through experimentation or advanced analytics.<br>• Ability to collaborate cross‑functionally, working effectively with diverse teams to align outcomes with organizational and customer goals.<br>• High curiosity, strong ownership mindset, and a commitment to continuous learning and improvement.<br>• Support quantitative and qualitative primary research studies, conducting secondary research scans. Familiarity with research basics such as creating research briefs, questionnaire design, sampling, weighting, hypothesis testing.<br><br>The Team:<br><br>Analytics Research &amp; Data (ARD) is a forward‑looking insights organization focused on anticipating client needs and predicting future behaviours through data, analytics, customer research, and AI‑driven solutions. As part of ARD, your work will play a critical role in shaping Fidelity’s future—enhancing client experiences, enabling smarter decisions, and building enduring customer relationships.<br><br>Fidelity will reasonably accommodate associates with disabilities who need adjustments to participate in the application or interview process, or to perform the essential functions of their job.<br><br>Certifications:<br><br>Category:<br><br>Business Analytics and Insights</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_zvn4avLMCtC4juMPiZHKoAI_144" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CDEQSw" data-ved="2ahUKEwjy6-iN2YiYAxVQnGMGHYmIEiQQl5ACegQIMRBL"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwjy6-iN2YiYAxVQnGMGHYmIEiQQ5ZkFegQIMRBM"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwjy6-iN2YiYAxVQnGMGHYmIEiQQyo8CegQIMRBN"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Fidelity Investments Careers&#39;,job_title:&#39;Analyst, Data Analytics and Insights&#39;})","_zvn4avLMCtC4juMPiZHKoAI_145",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["share_link","https://www.google.com/search?q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026hl\u003den\u0026ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026udm\u003d8"],["jobs_posting_urls_1","https://jobs.fidelity.com/in/jobs/2132627/analyst-data-analytics-and-insights/?utm_campaign\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_source\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_medium\u003dorganic"],["jobs_posting_domain_1",""],["jobs_posting_urls_2","https://recruiseglobal.com/professionals/op